{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_31_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_31","textTraditional":"一、二年，春王二月，葬陳莊公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_31_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_31","textTraditional":"二、夏，公子慶父帥師伐於餘丘。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_31_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_31","textTraditional":"於餘丘者何？邾婁之邑也。曷為不繫乎邾婁？國之也。曷為國之？君存焉爾。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_31_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_31","textTraditional":"三、秋七月，齊王姬卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_31_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_31","textTraditional":"外夫人不卒，此何以卒？錄焉爾。曷為錄焉爾？我主之也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_31_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_31","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，夫人姜氏會齊侯于郜。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_31_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_31","textTraditional":"五、乙酉，宋公馮卒。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}